{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"极化流形"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“极化流形”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>极化流形 (polarized manifold) 是紧"},{"Local":{"url":"复流形","text":"复流形"}},{"Plain":" $M$ 配备"},{"Local":{"url":"正线丛","text":"正线丛"}},{"Plain":" $L$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"代数簇","text":"代数簇"}},{"Plain":"是极化流形, 因为 $\\mathbb P^n(\\mathbb{C})$ 上的线丛 $\\mathcal O(1)$ 的拉回是一个正线丛.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"小平嵌入定理","text":"小平嵌入定理"}},{"Plain":"是上述命题的逆.</p>\n"}]}}